CLASS S  RANK 9

00:08:48.430 --> 00:08:51.160
DRIVE KNIGHT

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:57.170
CLASS S  RANK 8

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:57.170
ZOMBIEMAN

00:08:52.250 --> 00:08:57.170
